-Salat): Detailed Injunctions about Witr\nL53: \nL54: (505)\nL55: \nL56: Chapter: Regarding The Mu'awwidhatain\nL57: \nL58: (19)\nL59: \nL60: باب فِي الْمُعَوِّذَتَيْنِ\nL61: \nL62: Sunan Abi Dawud 1463\nL63: \nL64: Narrated Uqbah ibn Amir:\nL65: \nL66: White I was travelling with the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) between al-Juhfah and al-Abwa', a wind and intense darkness enveloped us, whereupon the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) began to seek refuge in Allah, reciting: \"I seek refuge in the Lord of the dawn,\" and \"I seek refuge in the Lord of men.\"\nL67: He then said: Uqbah, use them when seeking refuge in Allah, for no one can use anything to compare with them for the purpose.\nL68: \nL69: Uqbah added: I heard him reciting them when he led the people in prayer.\nL70: حَدَّثَنَا 【10†عَبْدُ اللَّهِ بْنُ مُحَمَّدٍ النُّفَيْلِيُّ】، حَدَّثَنَا 【11†مُحَمَّدُ بْنُ سَلَمَةَ】، عَنْ 【12†مُحَمَّدِ بْنِ إِسْحَاقَ】، عَنْ 【13†سَعِيدِ بْنِ أَبِي سَعِيدٍ الْمَقْبُرِيِّ】، عَنْ 【14†أَبِيهِ】، عَنْ 【15†عُقْبَةَ بْنِ عَامِرٍ】، قَالَ بَيْنَا أَنَا أَسِيرُ، مَعَ رَسُولِ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه وسلم بَيْنَ الْجُحْفَةِ وَالأَبْوَاءِ إِذْ غَشِيَتْنَا رِيحٌ وَظُلْمَةٌ شَدِيدَةٌ فَجَعَلَ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه وسلم يَتَعَوَّذُ بِـ ‏‏{‏ أَعُوذُ بِرَبِّ الْفَلَقِ ‏}‏ وَ ‏‏{‏ أَعُوذُ بِرَبِّ النَّاسِ ‏}‏ وَيَقُولُ ‏\"‏ يَا عُقْبَةُ تَعَوَّذْ بِهِمَا فَمَا تَعَوَّذَ مُتَعَوِّذٌ بِمِثْلِهِمَا ‏\" ‏ ‏.‏ قَالَ وَسَمِعْتُهُ يَؤُمُّنَا بِهِمَا فِي الصَّلاَةِ ‏.‏\nL71: Grade:  |  Sahih (Al-Albani)  |   صحيح   (الألباني)  | حكم   :\nL72: \nL73: Reference  |  : 【16†Sunan Abi Dawud 1463】\nL74: In-book reference  |  : Book 8, Hadith 48\nL75: English translation  |  : Book 8, Hadith 1458\nL76: \nL77: Report Error | Share | Copy ▼\nL78: \nL79: 【17†1462】【18†1464】\nL80: \nL81: 【19†About】 | 【20†News】 | 【21†Support】 | 【22†Developers】 | 【23†Contact】 | 【0†Donate】\nL82: \nL83: Hadith Text [Input]Arabic [Input]Translation [Input]Grade Reference [Input]Concise [Input]Detailed [Input]URL\n",
